SuperLite - IMC-DDMC Radiation Transport Code for Interacting Transients
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The code setup instructions and documentation is available at
https://gururajw.github.io/superlite_docs/
(note: this fork has replaced the legacy Make build described there with
CMake presets — see below).

Quickstart (this fork)
----------------------
Requires CMake >= 3.23, gfortran >= 10, LAPACK/BLAS; optional OpenMPI,
Python 3 + numpy/h5py for the regression tests.

    cmake --preset gfortran-openmp          # or gfortran-serial / -mpi / -debug
    cmake --build --preset gfortran-openmp -j
    ctest --preset gfortran-openmp          # smoke run + statistical regression

See OVERHAUL.md for the modernization plan and tests/regression/ for the
regression-harness details.

